## Milk Maid Lore

{{ decnpc(actorUUID).name }} is a Milk Maid and produces milk.

Skyrim milk comes from Milk Maids; cow milk is considered barbaric. It is a common staple drink and a mild aphrodisiac. Milk Maids are the socially valued backbone of Skyrim's milk supply. Women may become Milk Maids through Lactacid sold by alchemists, unusual milk, magic, curses, blessings, potions, experiments, accidents, voluntary transformation, or birth; many traditionally begin lactating at adulthood as a rite of passage.
